00:15:46.000 --> 00:16:24.000
Eager to expand his gun collection, within months, Julian had purchased a Mossberg 12 gauge pump-action shotgun and an M14 Narinco semi-automatic military rifle. Since late high school, Julian had been in a tumultuous relationship with a young woman named Katie, not her real name. Although the two had been together for two years, their relationship aired on the toxic side, fuelled by Julian's infidelity early on. Katie was one of the few people who saw Julian's emotional side. On multiple occasions, he had gotten drunk and broken down, crying to her about being

