00:33:55.000 --> 00:34:23.000
unseen gunman. Drivers desperately steered out of the line of fire. Some managed to floor down Hodel Street and out of danger. Many others only got as far as the mobile service station, where Alan Jury and Monica Vitelli had taken sanctuary. Over the following minutes, a long line of cars had gathered there. The passenger side of each was littered with bullet holes. Drivers and passengers emerged shaken and confused.

